<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - REUTERS RAND FOREX POLL, FULL DETAILS.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - REUTERS RAND FOREX POLL, FULL DETAILS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are results of the</p>
<p>quarterly Reuters poll of economists and currency analysts</p>
<p>conducted in the last week of September.</p>
<p>The figures carried are quarterly averages.</p>
<p>			1996     1997</p>
<p>			Q4	 Q1	 Q2	 Q3	 Q4</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Rand $    -  4.51  -  4.57  -  4.64  -  4.71  -  4.77  -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Rand Stg  -  7.00  -  7.08  -  7.21  -  7.30  -  7.38  -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Rand DM   - 0.3336 - 0.3286 - 0.3206 - 0.3173 - 0.3117 -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Rand Yen  -  24.07 -  23.54 -  23.00 -  22.58 -  22.16 -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Ranges:</p>
<p>	   Rand/$     Rand/Stg     Rand/DM	  Rand/Yen</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Q4 '96 - 4.46/55 -  6.94/7.11  - 0.34/0.33   -  24.55/23.04  - </p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Q1 '97 - 4.48/65 -  6.90/7.35  - 0.3356/3195 -  24.62/22.15  -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Q2     - 4.51/75 -  7.00/7.43  - 0.3333/3100 -  24.45/22.10  -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Q3     - 4.55/80 -  7.11/7.70  - 0.3300/3008 -  23.66/21.68  -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Q4     - 4.59/90 -  7.16/7.80  - 0.3268/3000 -  23.50/20.75  -</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The eight respondents to the survey were Anglo American Corp</p>
<p>of South Africa, UAL Merchant Bank, Standard Bank, Investec,</p>
<p>Syfrets Managed Assets, Iscor, Old Mutual and First National</p>
<p>Bank.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
